#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Every function's description and grants, in one place. Regenerates
# functions/<name>/<name>.json; never edit those by hand (bin/fnjson.py, as Tasks').
#   table   read        table:rw  + write rows        table:rwd  + delete rows
#   function:<name>     run it        /folder:verbs   a folder
set -euo pipefail
cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."
f() { uv run --no-project python bin/fnjson.py "$@"; }
f sprints_setup_save "Sprints' set-up, by the lead: sprint length (1-4 weeks), start day, time zone, points or a task count, and who plans and closes. Makes Sprint 1 on the next start day (with sample, none: run sprints_sample_data next), and writes Sprints' memory block. Safe to run again from Settings." sprints_settings:rw sprints_sprint:rw function:sprints_memory function:sprints_needs_you
f sprints_on_task "A team task changed or came in (Sprints' triggers on task). Records what moved in the running sprint, with the value before, and offers urgent work from a watched source to the lead as a pull-in." task tasks_activity sprints_settings sprints_sprint sprints_item:rw sprints_event:rw sprints_estimate sprints_suggestion:rw function:sprints_needs_you function:sprints_tick
f sprints_needs_you "What in Sprints needs the sprint lead, written to the shared needs_you list (Today reads it): Plan Sprint N, Close Sprint N, and urgent work that came in mid-sprint. Runs as the person; resolves what no longer applies." sprints_settings sprints_sprint sprints_item task sprints_suggestion needs_you:rw
f sprints_add "Put team tasks into a sprint. tasks: ids or numbers (#444). sprint: current, next or a number (default: the running sprint, else the next). Added after the start it shows as added, never as planned. Private tasks must be shared from Tasks first. assign: task -> {user_id, name} or {agent}." task:rw personal_task sprints_settings sprints_sprint:rw sprints_item:rwd sprints_event:rw sprints_estimate sprints_suggestion:rw function:sprints_needs_you function:sprints_tick
f sprints_remove "Take team tasks out of a sprint: to the backlog, or (to next) into the sprint being planned. After the start the task stays on the record as taken out." task sprints_sprint sprints_item:rwd sprints_event:rw sprints_estimate sprints_suggestion:rw function:sprints_add function:sprints_tick
f sprints_estimate "Set a team task's estimate in points (task: id or number; points null clears it). After a sprint starts, in-at-start stays as it was and the change is recorded." task sprints_estimate:rwd sprints_item:rw sprints_sprint sprints_event:rw
f sprints_capacity "Each person's capacity for a sprint: their usual (mean finished in their last 3 closed sprints) times the share of working days they are here. No history: no capacity yet, never a guess. Agents count in tasks." sprints_settings sprints_sprint sprints_item task sprints_estimate sprints_away
f sprints_start "Start the planned sprint: freezes what is in it (in at start) and each person's capacity, and opens the next one for planning. Only when no sprint is running. For the lead." sprints_settings sprints_sprint:rw sprints_item:rw task sprints_estimate sprints_away function:sprints_needs_you
f sprints_tick "The lead's daily run: opens and starts sprints when due, reconciles the running sprint with the task table, prepares the close on the last day, refreshes what may slip, and writes the lead's items. only=risks refreshes what may slip alone." sprints_settings sprints_sprint:rw sprints_item:rw sprints_event:rw sprints_estimate sprints_suggestion:rwd task function:sprints_start function:sprints_close_prepare function:sprints_needs_you function:sprints_on_task
f sprints_close_prepare "Prepare a sprint's close: one Decisions call per unfinished task (carry, split, backlog or drop, and why), and the summary drafted from the computed numbers and task lines. mode summary drafts the summary again." sprints_settings sprints_sprint:rw sprints_item task sprints_estimate sprints_away sprints_suggestion:rw function:sprints_needs_you
f sprints_close "Close the running sprint with a choice for each unfinished task (carry, split, backlog, drop): writes the numbers, the summary and /sprints/<n>.md, and opens the next sprint with the carried work. For the lead." sprints_settings sprints_sprint:rw sprints_item:rw sprints_event:rw sprints_estimate:rw sprints_suggestion:rw task:rw sprints_away /sprints:read,write function:sprints_needs_you
f sprints_memory "Tells this Lemma's agents that Sprints is installed: Sprints' own block in /memory/AGENTS.md and its guide at /memory/plugins/sprints.md, leaving the team's notes alone. Set-up runs it; safe to run again. remove takes both out." /memory:read,write
f sprints_sample_data "load: a made-up team's Sprints 42 to 48 around today (47 running), to look around. clear: removes only what the sample made and opens Sprint 1." task:rwd sprints_settings:rw sprints_sprint:rwd sprints_item:rwd sprints_event:rwd sprints_estimate:rwd sprints_away:rwd sprints_suggestion:rwd sprints_sample_row:rwd tasks_activity:rwd tasks_run:rwd tasks_decision:rwd function:sprints_on_task function:sprints_tick function:sprints_needs_you
